Muster is a fork of Timeful (https://github.com/schej-it/timeful.app)
by the Schej team, taken on 2026-09-29 at commit cd03b3fc
(tag upstream-base-20260929).

What this fork changes:

- Rebrand to Asymbl Muster, including the palette, wordmark, and landing page
- Removal of premium gating, ads, Stripe, and the upstream Discord, Slack, and Reddit integrations
- Deployment aimed at https://muster.asymbl.app

